<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market dormant - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market dormant - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was at a standstill in the Panhandle area Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers. There were 4,500 head confirmed for the week to date. Confirmed - None</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
